    "created_at": "2016-02-08T07:41:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-08T07:41:39Z",
    "body": "I think I prefer option 2, because a `textContent` primitive (the concatenation of all _descendant_ text nodes) is something that even non-browsers could trivially implement. The concatenation of all _child_ text nodes is only barely simpler.\n\nAlso, I'm not sure why authors should be asked to use `<b><time>2016-02-08</time></b>` instead of `<time><b>2016-02-08</b></time>`.\n",
