    "created_at": "2016-02-09T07:05:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-09T07:05:43Z",
    "body": "> So how about going back to \"no time element descendants\" plus the \"must match requirements described in prose below\" recently added?\n\nYeah to me that clearly seems like a helpful restriction for authors. But I’m still interested in hearing what @Hixie currently thinks on all this.\n",
