    "body": "That's a good point. If it should ever happen that a browser implements `HTMLTimeElement` and uses the date for something itself, then the `textContent` model would be a problem.\n\nGoing with only child text nodes isn't entirely satisfactory either, because one would need a new concept that joins the child text nodes while skipping comments and processing instructions, which are allowed, and elements and other things which are not allowed.\n\nWDYT, @sideshowbarker?\n",
