    "body": "Why would we change the parser?\n\nThe concept of only looking at **child** Text nodes, and ignoring elements (if you put them there using DOM API or XHTML syntax), is used by `style`, `script`, `title`. That the HTML parser also has special behavior for these elements is separate.\n",
